32:           "type": "string",
33:           "enum": ["python", "java", "nodejs", "cpp", "rust", "go", "dotnet", "other"],
34:           "description": "库的核心语言生态，由模型根据 manifest 与主语言判断。取值：python / java / nodejs / cpp / rust / go / dotnet / other"
